zImage-dtb: Linux 3.4 kernel for the Nokia Lumia 930 with the martini
simple-framebuffer device tree appended (msm8974-v2.2-martini-simplefb.dtb:
screen on the framebuffer the UEFI leaves running, MDSS off). The ROM uses the
MDSS device tree; the recovery keeps the simple-framebuffer one until the MDSS
panel takeover has been seen working on a phone. Built, never booted.

Source: https://github.com/lumia-msm8974/android_kernel_nokia_msm8974
Branch: lineage-18.1-martini, commit ac5369ab
Config: lineage_martini_defconfig
Toolchain: arm-linux-androideabi-4.9 (LineageOS 18.1 prebuilts)
Build: build-env/build-kernel.sh in the Lumia 930 project (zImage + msm8974-v2.2-martini-simplefb.dtb)
SHA-256: 46a9bdd8177a82a1997281383e05b62176f380c60bfbf73cb7c6e87e1d29ebc9
